{"Swap jewels, chase cascades, finish the goals.":"交换珠宝，追逐瀑布，完成目标。","Choose a mode":"选择模式","Mode select":"模式选择","Play":"开始游戏","Learn":"教学","Journey":"旅程","Daily":"每日","Practice":"练习","Challenge":"挑战","Score chase":"分数追逐","Daily challenge":"每日挑战","Short hands-on lessons — one rule at a time.":"简短的实践课程——一次一条规则。","40 authored stages with growing mechanics.":"40 个手工阶段，机制不断增长。","One shared seed per UTC day. Same board for everyone.":"每个 UTC 天一个共享种子。每个人都使用同一个板。","Your difficulty, your seed, undo allowed. Unrated.":"你的困难，你的种子，允许撤消。未评级。","Tight move limits, timers and altered layouts.":"严格的移动限制、计时器和改变的布局。","Chase the board on a validated shareable seed.":"在可分享的已验证种子上追逐棋盘。","Help":"帮助","How to play":"玩法说明","Settings":"设置","Profile":"个人资料","Profile & privacy":"个人资料和隐私","Achievements":"成就","Achievements unlocked":"已解锁成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","Boards":"棋盘","Global":"全球","Friends":"好友","Back":"返回","Close":"关闭","Start":"开始","Skip":"跳过","Text board":"文本板","Click a jewel, then an adjacent jewel, to swap. Keyboard: arrows move the cursor, Enter selects.":"点击一颗宝石，然后点击相邻的宝石进行交换。键盘：方向键移动光标，Enter 选择。","Guest":"访客","guest":"访客","Player":"玩家","Stage {n} of {total} · {stars}★":"{total}·{stars}★的阶段{n}★","{name} · mastery {level}":"{name}·精通{level}","Best {score}":"最佳 {score}","new board in {time}":"{time}新板","cloud: offline":"云：离线","cloud: saving…":"云：保存中…","cloud: synced":"云：已同步","Cloud save applied.":"云存档已应用。","Resume round?":"恢复回合？","You have an interrupted round:":"您的回合已中断：","{name} — score {score}, {moves} moves left.":"{name}——得分{score}，{moves}向左移动。","Resume":"继续","Discard":"丢弃","Round":"回合","Setup — {mode}":"设置 — {mode}","Rules":"规则","Goals":"目标","Expected duration":"预计时长","Players":"玩家","Assists":"辅助功能","Ranked?":"排名？","Ranked":"排名","Ranked (personal bests)":"排名（个人最好成绩）","Ranked (recorded locally)":"排名（本地记录）","Casual":"休闲","{w}×{h} · {colors} colors · {moves} moves":"{w}×{h} · {colors} 颜色 · {moves} 移动","unlimited":"无限","{n} ice":"{n}冰","{n} crates":"{n} 板条箱","{time} timed":"{time}定时","~{n} min":"约 {n} 分钟","undo":"撤销","no undo":"无法撤销","hints":"提示","no hints":"无提示","timing assist ×1.5":"定时辅助×1.5","Finish every guided step.":"完成每个引导步骤。","done":"已完成","best {score}":"最佳 {score}","One shared seed per UTC day; your best is kept. Next board in {time}.":"每个UTC日一个共享种子；你最好的都会被保留。下一块板在{time}。","Seed":"种子","Seed (optional)":"种子（可选）","Seed: {seed}":"种子：{seed}","random":"随机","Random":"随机","any word or phrase":"任何单词或短语","Today's seed":"今天的种子","Share a seed with a friend to chase the same board. Fixed ruleset: the same seed and moves always give the same score.":"与朋友分享种子以追逐同一个棋盘。固定规则集：相同的种子和动作总是给出相同的分数。","Stage {n}":"阶段 {n}","Stage {n} — {name}":"阶段 {n} — {name}","(mastery)":"（精通）","{n} stars":"{n} 颗星","locked":"已锁定","{done} of {total} stages complete · {stars}★ earned · mastery stages marked ◆":"{done} 的 {total} 阶段完成 · {stars}★ 获得 · 掌握阶段标记 ◆","Daily — {date}":"每日 — {date}","Practice — {level}":"练习 — {level}","Objective":"目标","Score":"分数","Moves":"步数","Time":"时间","Board":"棋盘","Pause":"暂停","Paused":"已暂停","Hint":"提示","Undo":"撤销","Restart round":"重新开始回合","Leave to menu":"离开至菜单","Lesson":"课程","Your move":"轮到你了","Settling…":"解决……","Resumed":"已继续","Get ready":"准备就绪","Ready…":"准备…","Set…":"设置……","Go!":"开始！","Go! {name}":"走吧！ {name}","Undo allowed":"允许撤销","No hints":"无提示","Collect {n} {color}":"收集 {n} 个{color}","Break {n} ice":"打破 {n} 个冰块","Break {n} crates":"打破 {n} 个板条箱","Score {n}":"得分 {n}","{n} to go":"{n} 去","{n} left":"{n}左","Score {n}.":"得分{n}。","Unlimited moves.":"无限移动。","{n} moves left.":"{n}向左移动。","{n} seconds":"{n} 秒","ruby":"红宝石","amber":"琥珀色","topaz":"黄玉","emerald":"翡翠","sapphire":"蓝宝石","amethyst":"紫水晶","opal":"蛋白石","horizontal ray":"水平射线","vertical ray":"垂直射线","bloom":"绽放","prism":"棱镜","row {r} column {c}: {what}":"行{r}列{c}：{what}","crate, 1 hit left":"板条箱，还剩 1 个命中","crate, {n} hits left":"板条箱，{n} 向左击中","frozen":"冷冻","frozen deeply":"深度冷冻","empty":"空","selected":"已选择","unlimited moves":"无限移动","{n} moves left":"剩余 {n} 步","{n} legal swaps.":"{n} 合法互换。","The round is over.":"回合已结束。","That cell is outside the board.":"该格子在棋盘之外。","Jewels must be neighbours to swap.":"宝石必须是邻居才能交换。","There is no jewel there.":"那里没有宝石。","Crates cannot be moved — match beside them.":"木箱无法移动——在它们旁边匹配。","That jewel is frozen in ice. Match through it to crack it.":"那颗宝石被冻结在冰中。匹配它来破解它。","That swap makes no line of three.":"该交换不构成三行。","That move was not understood.":"这一举动未被理解。","Already done.":"已完成。","Nothing to undo.":"无可撤销。","Hold on — the board is settling.":"稍等——棋盘正在稳定。","The lesson is guiding a different move.":"教训是指导不同的行动。","That move is not legal.":"该步棋不合法。","Hint: watch the two highlighted jewels.":"提示：观看两颗突出显示的珠宝。","Hint shown on the board.":"板上显示提示。","Undone.":"已撤销。","Camera: {preset}":"相机：{preset}","default":"默认","low":"低","high":"高","Step {n} of {total}":"步骤 {n} / {total}","Lesson step {n} of {total}.":"{total}的课程步骤{n}。","End lesson":"结束课程","Lesson complete!":"课程完成！","Results":"结算","Commission complete!":"委托完成！","Out of moves":"步数用尽","Round resigned":"回合已认输","Time expired":"时间已过期","Round over":"回合结束","{n} stars.":"{n} 星。","Score breakdown":"得分明细","Component":"组件","Points":"分数","Total":"总计","Matches":"比赛","Cascade bonuses":"连锁奖励","Specials":"特价","Blockers cleared":"已清除阻挡物","Goal bonuses":"进球奖金","Unused-move bonus":"未使用的移动奖励","No points scored":"没有得分","Mastery":"精通","+{xp} XP · level {level}":"+{xp} 经验值 · 等级 {level}","level up!":"升级！","{n} XP to next":"{n} XP到下一个","Unlocked {type}: {name}":"解锁的{type}：{name}","theme":"主题","trail":"轨迹","frame":"框架","title":"标题","Daily streak {n} 🔥":"每日连胜 {n} 🔥","New personal best on this board!":"此板上新的个人最好成绩！","Personal best on this board: {score}.":"该板上的个人最佳成绩：{score}。","Next stage":"下一阶段","Next lesson":"下一课","Play again":"再玩一次","Retry":"重试","Replay":"重玩","Replay unavailable for this round.":"本轮无法重播。","Replay of your round — {n} moves.":"重播您的回合 — {n} 动作。","Replay complete — final score {score}.":"重播完成——最终得分{score}。","End replay":"结束回放","Audio":"音频","Muted":"已静音","Sound on":"声音开启","Captions for audio cues":"音频提示字幕","Display & accessibility":"显示与无障碍","Color palette":"色板","Default":"默认","Deuteranopia-safe":"绿色盲安全","Protanopia-safe":"红色盲安全","Tritanopia-safe":"蓝色盲安全","High contrast":"高对比度","Left-handed layout":"左手布局","Hold to drag jewels":"按住拖动宝石","Timing assistance":"计时辅助","Camera":"镜头","Low (near tabletop)":"低（靠近桌面）","High (top-down)":"高（自上而下）","Controls":"控制","Actions":"操作","Camera preset":"相机预设","Display name":"显示名称","Replay tutorials (reset progress)":"重播教程（重置进度）","Tutorials reset — they will play again from Learn.":"教程重置——它们将从学习中再次播放。","Danger zone":"危险地带","Reset all data":"重置所有数据","Reset all data?":"重置所有数据？","Erase every local setting, progress record and snapshot for this game.":"删除该游戏的所有本地设置、进度记录和快照。","This erases every local setting, progress record, and snapshot for Jewel Cascade on this device. This cannot be undone.":"这将擦除该设备上的 Jewel Cascade 的每个本地设置、进度记录和快照。此操作无法撤消。","Erase everything":"全部擦除","Cancel":"取消","Cosmetics":"外观装饰","Cosmetics change looks only — never rules, timing, or information.":"外观只改变外观——绝不改变规则、时机或信息。","Theme":"主题","Trail":"小径","Frame":"框架","Title":"标题","(locked)":"（已锁定）","Career":"生涯","Rounds completed":"已完成回合","Rounds won":"已获胜回合","Current win streak":"当前连胜","Best win streak":"最佳连胜纪录","Total score":"总分","Daily streak":"每日连胜","Level {level} · {xp} XP":"等级 {level} · {xp} XP","{n} to next":"{n} 到下一个","max level":"最高等级","{n} of {total} unlocked.":"{total}的{n}被解锁。","Unlocked {date}.":"解锁{date}。","Loading boards…":"正在加载面板…","No entries yet — be the first.":"暂无条目——成为第一个吧。","Personal bests on this device:":"此设备上的个人最好成绩：","Boards unavailable right now. Personal bests:":"棋盘当前不可用。个人最佳成绩：","When":"时间","No local results yet.":"尚无本地结果。","Local bests (casual)":"局部最佳（休闲）","Ember Dusk":"余烬黄昏","Moonlit Forge":"月光熔炉","Verdant Atelier":"翠绿工作室","Frostbound Loft":"霜冻阁楼","Royal Velvet":"皇家天鹅绒","None":"无","Sparks":"火花","Comet embers":"彗星余烬","Standard":"标准","Brass":"黄铜","Filigree":"花丝","Apprentice":"学徒","Cascade Master":"连锁大师","Swap & match":"交换&匹配","Swap two neighbouring jewels (drag, or tap one then the other). A swap only counts when it lines up three or more of a color. Keyboard: {keys} move the cursor, {confirm} selects.":"交换两个相邻的宝石（拖动或点击一个然后点击另一个）。仅当将三种或更多颜色排成一行时，交换才算数。键盘：{keys} 移动光标，{confirm} 选择。","Moves & goals":"动作和目标","Every accepted swap spends one move. Finish all goals before moves run out. Goals sit in the objective rail; the HUD shows moves and score.":"每个接受的交换花费一次移动。在步数用完之前完成所有目标。目标位于目标轨道上； HUD 显示动作和得分。","Rays (4 in a line)":"射线（4条线）","A line of four forges a ray. It fires when matched or struck and clears a whole row or column.":"四个连成一线形成一道射线。它在匹配或被击中时发射，并清除整行或整列。","Blooms (L or T)":"绽放（L形或T形）","Matching around a corner grows a bloom, which clears a 3×3 patch when it fires.":"在角落周围匹配会长出一朵花，当它开火时会清除一个 3×3 的区域。","Prisms (5 in a line)":"棱镜（5个排成一行）","Five in a line cut a prism. Swap it with a jewel to shatter every jewel of that color; swap it with another special for a bigger effect.":"五个排成一行切割棱镜。将其与宝石交换，以粉碎该颜色的所有宝石；与其他特殊产品交换以获得更大的效果。","Ice":"冰","Frozen jewels cannot move but still match. Matching through ice cracks it; deep ice takes two hits.":"冻结的珠宝无法移动但仍匹配。穿过冰块匹配将其破解；深冰会受到两次打击。","Crates":"板条箱","Crates hold no jewel and never move. Matches next to a crate dent it; banded crates take two hits.":"木箱不含宝石且永不移动。在木箱旁边匹配会将其击凹；带条纹的木箱需要两次打击。","Stars & mastery":"星星与掌握","Finish goals for ★, beat score thresholds for ★★ and ★★★. Every round earns mastery XP toward cosmetic themes, trails, frames, and titles — looks only, never power.":"完成目标为★，超过得分阈值为★★和★★★。每一轮都会获得对外观主题、轨迹、框架和标题的精通 XP——只有外观，而不是力量。","Fair play":"公平游戏","Scoring is deterministic: the same seed and the same moves always produce the same score. Daily seeds never change once published.":"评分是确定性的：相同的种子和相同的动作总是产生相同的分数。每日种子一旦发布就不会改变。","[low buzz]":"[低嗡嗡声]","[chime]":"[铃声]","[chime rising x{n}]":"[钟声升起x{n}]","[sparkle]":"[闪闪发光]","[big blast]":"[大爆炸]","[blast]":"[爆炸]","[ice crack]":"[冰裂]","[crate breaks]":"[板条箱破裂]","[swirl]":"[漩涡]","[warm bell]":"[暖铃]","[win fanfare]":"[赢得大张旗鼓]","[soft descending tone]":"[柔和的降调]","[time warning]":"[时间警告]","Lesson 1 — First Swaps":"第 1 课 — 第一次交换","Swap two neighbouring jewels to line up three of a kind.":"交换两颗相邻的宝石以排列三颗相同的宝石。","This is your workbench. Jewels line up when three or more of a color touch in a row or column. Swap the marked ruby down into the gap — drag it, or tap one jewel and then its neighbour.":"这是您的工作台。当三种或更多颜色在行或列中接触时，珠宝就会排列起来。将标记的红宝石向下交换到间隙中 - 拖动它，或点击一颗宝石，然后点击它的邻居。","A match of three! Matched jewels leave the board and new ones cascade in from above. Now make any legal swap of your own.":"一个三消！匹配的宝石离开棋盘，新的从上面级联进来。现在进行你自己的任何合法交换。","Well done. A swap only counts when it makes a line — a swap that matches nothing is refused and the jewels slide back.":"干得好。交换只有在排成一条线时才算数——没有任何匹配的交换会被拒绝，珠宝会滑回来。","Lesson 2 — Rays (lines of 4)":"第 2 课 — 射线（4 行）","Match four in a line to forge a ray.":"将四个连成一条线来锻造一条射线。","Four in a line forge a RAY. Swap the marked topaz down to complete a line of four.":"四人排成一列锻造射线。将标记的黄玉向下交换，形成四颗一线。","You forged a ray! A ray fires when it is matched or struck, clearing its whole row or column. Rays carry a color and match like ordinary jewels. Make any swap to continue.":"你锻造了一条射线！射线在匹配或撞击时会发射，清除其整行或整列。光线与普通珠宝一样具有颜色和搭配。进行任何交换以继续。","Lesson 3 — Blooms (corners)":"第 3 课 — Bloom（角）","Match an L or T shape to grow a bloom.":"匹配L或T形状来种植花朵。","Matching around a corner — an L or a T — grows a BLOOM. Swap the marked sapphire left into the corner.":"在拐角处匹配——L或T——会生长出BLOOM。将左侧标记的蓝宝石交换到角落中。","A bloom! When it fires it clears a 3×3 patch around itself. Make any swap to continue.":"一朵绽放！触发时会清除自身周围3×3的区域。进行任意交换以继续。","Lesson 4 — Prisms (lines of 5)":"第 4 课 — 棱镜（5 行）","Match five in a line to cut a prism.":"将五个连成一线以切割棱镜。","Five in a line cut a PRISM — the rarest jewel on the bench. Swap the marked emerald down to complete five.":"五人排成一排切割棱镜——长凳上最稀有的宝石。将标记的祖母绿向下交换以完成五个。","A prism! Swap a prism with any neighbour to shatter every jewel of that color — or with another special for something spectacular. Make any swap to continue.":"一个棱镜！将棱镜与任何相邻的宝石交换，可以粉碎该颜色的所有宝石——或者与另一个特殊宝石交换，制造壮观效果。进行任意交换以继续。","Lesson 5 — Ice":"第 5 课 — 冰","Frozen jewels cannot move. Match through them to crack the ice.":"冻结的珠宝无法移动。通过它们来消除冰块。","Jewels under ice are frozen — they cannot be swapped, but they still match. Swap the marked sapphire down so the line runs THROUGH the frozen jewel, cracking its ice.":"冰下的珠宝被冻结——它们无法交换，但它们仍然匹配。将标记的蓝宝石向下交换，使线穿过冻结的宝石，使冰破裂。","Cracked! The ice broke and the jewel was collected. One more frozen jewel remains on the bench — play on and break it, or just finish the round.":"碎裂！冰层破裂，宝石已被收集。长凳上还剩下最后一颗冰冻宝石——继续游戏击碎它，或直接结束本轮。","Lesson 6 — Crates":"第 6 课 — 板条箱","Crates block cells. Matches beside them break them.":"木箱阻挡格子。在它们旁边的匹配可以打破它们。","Crates pin the board: they hold no jewel and never move. A match made NEXT to a crate dents it. Swap the marked emerald down — the line will smash both crates at once.":"木箱固定了棋盘：它们不含宝石且永不移动。在木箱旁边进行匹配会将其击凹。将标记的祖母绿向下交换——这一线将同时击碎两个木箱。","Both crates broke from one match! Tough crates take two hits. Make any swap to finish the lesson.":"两个板条箱因一次匹配而破裂！坚固的板条箱需要两次击中。进行任意交换以完成教程。","First Light":"第一缕曙光","Gather rubies and amber for the workshop lamps.":"收集红宝石和琥珀用于车间灯。","Kindling":"火种","Amber and topaz for the kiln.":"琥珀和黄玉用于窑炉。","Sixth Shelf":"第六个架子","A sixth color joins the bench.":"第六种颜色加入了长凳。","Triple Order":"三重订单","Three commissions at once.":"一次三个佣金。","Apprentice Trial":"学徒试炼","Mastery: prove the basics under a tighter move limit.":"精通：在更严格的移动限制下证明基础知识。","First Frost":"初霜","A cold snap froze six jewels. Match through them to crack the ice.":"寒潮冻结了六颗宝石。通过它们进行匹配以打破冰层。","Thin Ice":"薄冰","More frost, same patience.":"更多的霜，同样的耐心。","Deep Freeze":"深度冻结","Double ice takes two hits each.":"双层冰每个需要两次击打。","Frozen Cargo":"冷冻货物","Free the amethyst shipment.":"释放紫水晶货物。","Glacier Trial":"冰川审判","Mastery: heavy frost, full commission.":"精通：重霜，满佣金。","Packing Day":"包装日","Crates block cells. Match beside them to break them.":"木箱阻挡格子。在它们旁边匹配以打破它们。","Heavy Stock":"厚重库存","More crates in the way.":"路上有更多板条箱。","Reinforced":"强化","Sturdy crates take two hits.":"坚固的板条箱可承受两次撞击。","Warehouse Maze":"仓库迷宫","Crates in a cut-corner hall.":"切角大厅中的木箱。","Storekeeper Trial":"店主审判","Mastery: frost and freight together.":"精通：霜冻和货运在一起。","Broken Bench":"破损的长凳","Holes in the bench change how jewels fall.":"工作台上的孔改变了珠宝掉落的方式。","The Hollow":"空心","A hole in the middle of everything.":"万物中央的一个洞。","Cold Columns":"冰冷立柱","Split columns, frozen stock.":"分流柱，冷冻原料。","Quota":"配额","The guild wants points, not pretty colors. Cascades and specials pay best.":"公会想要积分，而不是漂亮的颜色。级联和特价产品性价比最高。","Comptroller Trial":"审计官试炼","Mastery: a high quota on a broken board.":"精通：破损板上的高配额。","Grand Bench":"大长凳","A wider workbench.":"一个更宽的工作台。","Seventh Color":"第七色","Opal joins the spectrum.":"蛋白石加入了光谱。","Opal Rush":"蛋白石热潮","Opals scatter the eye.":"蛋白石分散眼睛。","Frosted Gallery":"磨砂画廊","A cold gallery of seven colors.":"一个寒冷的七色画廊。","Curator Trial":"策展人试炼","Mastery: quota and frost on the grand bench.":"精通：大板凳上的配额和霜冻。","Deep Cold":"深层寒冷","The deep cold returns.":"严寒再次降临。","Ironbound":"铁界","Reinforced crates around the hollow.":"空心周围的加固板条箱。","Salt Cellar":"盐窖","Crates and frost in the cellar.":"地窖里的木箱和霜冻。","Night Audit":"夜间审核","Points and amethyst before dawn.":"黎明前的积分和紫水晶。","Warden Trial":"典狱长审判","Mastery: every blocker you know.":"精通：你所知道的每一个拦截器。","Twin Furnaces":"双炉","Two great orders, one bench.":"两个大订单，一张板凳。","Frozen Vault":"冰冻金库","A vault of seven-color frost.":"一个七色霜冻的宝库。","Crate District":"木箱街区","A district of freight.":"一个货运区。","High Quota":"高配额","The guild raises its sights.":"公会抬起了目光。","Assayer Trial":"鉴定师试炼","Mastery: quota among reinforced stock.":"精通：强化库存中的配额。","Ember Wind":"余烬风","A narrow waist concentrates the fall.":"一个狭窄的腰部集中了下落。","Moon Quota":"月球配额","Tight moves over cut corners.":"走捷径的紧逼动作。","Frozen Freight":"冷冻货运","The hardest storage room in the workshop.":"车间内最坚硬的储藏室。","Penultimate Order":"倒数第二个订单","Three colors, seven hues, no excuses.":"三种颜色，七种色调，没有任何借口。","Master of the Cascade":"级联大师","Final mastery: everything the workshop has taught you.":"最终掌握：研讨会教给您的一切。","One shared board for every player today. Same seed, same rules.":"今天每个玩家都有一个共享板。相同的种子，相同的规则。","Easy":"简单","Five colors, generous moves. Learn the rhythms.":"五种颜色，动作大方。学习节奏。","Medium":"中等","Six colors and a few crates.":"六种颜色和一些板条箱。","Hard":"困难","Frost on a split-column board.":"分柱板上的霜。","Expert":"专家","Seven colors, a quota, and no room for waste.":"七种颜色，一个配额，没有浪费的余地。","Sprint":"冲刺","Ninety seconds. Unlimited swaps — how much can you score?":"九十秒。无限交换——你能得分多少？","Eight Moves":"八步","Twelve emeralds in only eight swaps.":"仅八次交换就有十二颗祖母绿。","Ice Storm":"冰风暴","Crack sixteen sheets of ice before the moves run out.":"在步数耗尽前击碎十六块冰层。","Crate Maze":"木箱迷宫","A maze of freight. Clear every crate.":"一个货运迷宫。清除每个板条箱。","Hourglass":"沙漏","A tight-waisted board and a quota.":"一个紧腰的板子和一个配额。","Seven Seas":"七大洋","All seven colors, few moves, big order.":"所有七种颜色，少数步数，大订单。","Master's Eye":"大师之眼","No hints. Trust your reading of the board.":"没有提示。相信您对黑板的阅读。","Grand Trial":"大审判","Frost, freight, and a quota on the grand bench.":"霜冻、运费和大板凳上的配额。","Fixed ruleset, player-chosen seed. Reach {target} points in {moves} moves; every unused move banks +{bonus}.":"固定规则集，玩家选择的种子。在 {moves} 步数中达到 {target} 点；每个未使用的移动银行+{bonus}。","First Setting":"第一设置","Complete your first stage, any mode.":"完成你的第一个关卡，任何模式。","Full Spectrum Lapidary":"全光谱宝石","Create a ray, a bloom, and a prism over your career.":"在你的生涯中创造一道光线、一朵绽放和一个棱镜。","Steady Hands":"稳健操作","Win five rounds in a row, any mode.":"在任何模式下连续赢得五轮。","Complete the final Journey stage.":"完成最终的旅程关卡。","Hundred Evenings":"百夜","Complete one hundred rounds in total.":"总共完成一百轮。","{hint} hint · {undo} undo (practice) · {skip} skip animation · {camera} camera · {mute} mute · {pause} pause. Gamepad: {a} select, {b} cancel, {x} hint, {y} undo, {start} pause. Rebind everything in the StarHermit Options.":"{hint}提示·{undo}撤消（练习）·{skip}跳过动画·{camera}相机·{mute}静音·{pause}暂停。手柄：{a}选择、{b}取消、{x}提示、{y}撤消、{start}暂停。重新绑定 StarHermit 选项中的所有内容。","row {r} column {c}":"第 {r} 行第 {c} 列","Volumes for music, effects and the interface, the voice limit and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音乐、效果和界面的音量、声音限制和静音都在StarHermit选项中。","Text size, high contrast, reduced motion and vibration are in the StarHermit Options.":"文本大小、高对比度、减少的运动和振动都在StarHermit选项中。","Graphics quality, render scale and the frame-rate limit are in the StarHermit Options.":"图形质量、渲染比例和帧速率限制在StarHermit选项中。","Keys and gamepad buttons are rebound in the StarHermit Options.":"按键和手柄按钮可在 StarHermit 选项中重新绑定。","Progress reset.":"进度已重置。","Open Options":"打开选项","Mute game sounds":"静音游戏声音","High score":"最高分","Graphics":"图形","Change keys and buttons":"更改按键和按钮"}
